MODULE: TypeOKWindowOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: clock advancement corrupts the bounded refusal window
PERTURBS: RefusalWindowTick

--- FIND
    /\ hold > 0 /\ hold' = hold - 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the clock installs an out-of-domain remaining window.
    /\ hold > 0 /\ hold' = RefusedSweepHold + 1
--- END
